      "contextFingerprint": "334381918947006220c8b5c8283d156f6a6b45bd733498b9b44cda81462f819d",
      "sourceText": "综上所述，IMU在机器人领域具有实时性高、精度较高、不受光照条件限制、尺寸小巧和低功耗等优点。然而，它也存在累积误差、受外部干扰影响、不适用于绝对定位和无法感知环境信息等缺点。因此，在设计机器人系统时需综合考虑应用需求，并与其他传感器（如相机、激光雷达等）进行融合，以提升机器人的感知、定位和控制能力。",
      "translatedText": "In summary, IMUs in the field of robotics offer advantages such as high real\\-time performance, relatively high accuracy, insensitivity to lighting conditions, compact size, and low power consumption\\. However, they also have disadvantages, including cumulative errors, susceptibility to external interference, unsuitability for absolute localization, and inability to perceive environmental information\\. Therefore, when designing robotic systems, it is necessary to comprehensively consider application requirements and fuse IMUs with other sensors (such as cameras, LiDAR, etc\\.) to enhance the robot's perception, localization, and control capabilities\\.",
